  "prefLabel": "Ins 4401.02 Definitions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 4401.02 Definitions.\n\n(a) \"Actuarial certification\" means \"actuarial certification\" as defined in RSA 415-H:2, I.\n\n(b) \"Attachment point\" means \"attachment point\" as defined in RSA 415-H:2, II.\n\n(c) \"Expected claims\" means \"expected claims\" as defined in RSA 415-H:2, III.\n\nSource. #9244, eff 9-2-08; ss by #11149, eff 9-2-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins4400.html"
